        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: N.y.d.c. Café & Restaurants\n- Places: Singapore, Mississippi\n- Products: Mississippi mud pie\n- Topics: Restaurant chains, desserts, family recipes\n\nFacts:\n- N.y.d.c. Café & Restaurants is a restaurant chain based in Singapore.\n- N.y.d.c. Café & Restaurants serves homemade soups, breads, pastas, pizzas, cookies, pies, ice cream, mud pies, cheesecakes, and special cakes.\n- N.y.d.c. Café & Restaurants says its special cake recipes have been in its founder’s family for generations.\n- Mississippi mud pie is a chocolate-based dessert pie.\n- Mississippi mud pie likely originated in the U.S. state of Mississippi.",
